]]> One of the most handy tools you have access to in Pet Rescue is the Firecracker, If you look to the bottom right of your screen you will find a little meter that needs to be fed with points, the bigger the combinations the better.
Pet Rescue Saga is a match 3 puzzle game where you have to rescue pets.
If you can try to gather your metal boxes around a bomb that has been broken open, this will help destroy them for once and for all.
But like all tricky King games it is possible!
If you are finding yourself stuck on a Pet Rescue Saga level find some solace in the fact you are probably not alone !
The key to this game in my belief is consequence , every move you make will have a consequence and its up to you to firstly figure out what you need to do and how best to achieve this .
You first need to assess your board , have you a limited number of moves ?
are there Balloons , cages , pet boxes , springs , locks requiring keys or bombs that need to be broken free ?
Coloured balloons – pretty simple hit a red balloon and all the red bricks disappear , unless they are caged .
It is often important to focus on freeing these caged blocks otherwise you may find yourself out of moves .
just a little boom , nothing too dramatic here but the surrounding bricks will be destroyed , perfect for clearing the way for a lost little pooch , I like to save my bombs to be used at the very bottom .
Some levels have the bombs encased in glass that needs to be smashed first .
Blocks or pets dont drop past locked rocks , which is why they need to be freed in the first place !
Metal boxes – yeah they exist … I dont know why ?
They cannot be matched with anything to be destroyed ..unless its a bomb or a spring !
The first place to get help for Pet rescue Saga !
So come along with me and lets rescue some pets !
You need to first of all make sure you get rid of the block on the left hand side in the first row , as this is easily missed and , if you are aiming for 3-stars , can really scupper your plans .
Keep your Block Buster Boosters until the end so that you can clear any non-matching blocks left over .
