What does it mean that Shark has obtained the Ten Ring Certification (China Environmental Labeling Product Certification) qualification?
The company successfully passed the acceptance assessment of "Shanghai Science and Technology Little Giant" and obtained the "Excellent Rating" qualification!
It is understood that the Ten Rings logo (Chinese environmental label) is a kind of "certifying trademark" marked on the product or its packaging. It shows that the product is not only qualified in quality, but also meets specific environmental protection requirements.
According to official requirements, the prerequisite for an enterprise to apply for the ten-ring certification qualification is to have the "Environmental Assessment Report", which means that the environmental protection management and product environmental performance of the shark meet the current national environmental protection requirements.
According to the ten-ring certification and acceptance requirements, the physical properties and strength performance of the shark products need to be tested on site. The results show that the shark products have excellent performance, strong stability and weather resistance.
Factory inspection is to check whether the ISO quality management system is operating properly. This is a requirement that a company must have if it wants to obtain the ten-ring certification, which verifies the scientific and rigorous quality of the shark quality control system.
